  m_text: '<b>Design, code and levels</b>

    Muhammad Talha (BSCS23051), CS-464 Game Development, ITU


    <b>Font</b>

    Liberation Sans, the TextMesh Pro default font, SIL Open Font License 1.1


    <b>Music and sound effects</b>

    Made by me with a Python script (Tools/make_audio.py) that synthesises every sound.

    No third-party audio.


    <b>Course</b>

    Scripts from Lectures 04 to 10: player, hazards, health bar, pause, SfxPlayer, loader, SaveData.'
